    "details": {
      "alignment": "Unaligned",
      "type": {
        "value": "construct",
        "subtype": "Fawful-Bot"
      },
      "cr": 2,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Fawful's Forces packet sheet — Mustard Sprayer.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/fawfuls-forces.json</code> (entry <code>mustard-sprayer</code>): Medium construct (Fawful-Bot), Unaligned; CR 2 (proficiency +2, to hit +4 with STR); AC 14 (riveted tank plating), hit points 39 (6d8+12), speed 20 ft.. A GM scene kit for the Fawful's Forces article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>Fawful's hatred of mustard is a matter of record — the rants are quoted in the faction article — and the Mustard Sprayer is the revenge he took on it: a boiler of the stuff on treads, aimed at other people. It is slow and it is loud, and that is the point; a Sprayer is sent down a corridor first so that whatever is waiting at the end of it will be coated and easy for the drones to smell.</p><p>The tank is the weak point and the trap. Fire takes it apart quickly (it is vulnerable) and takes everyone standing next to it along for the ride, mustarded. Wipe the coat off before the Fury-Bots arrive; they hit a mustarded target far more often than a clean one.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> area controller · <strong>tier:</strong> Fawful-Bot · <strong>folder:</strong> Fawful's Furious Freaks / Machines of Fury.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/fawfuls-forces/mustard-sprayer.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 410003, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded cartoon character art in the style of Mario & Luigi RPG concept art, bold dark outlines, flat colours, simple shading. A squat round green robot on tank treads with a grinning face plate, a big mustard-yellow pressure tank on its back with brass pipes and gauges, a long brass hose arm ending in a nozzle dripping yellow mustard, yellow splashes on its body. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
